I confirm receipt and understanding of the following security constraints:

- `[SESS-EXP-1440MIN]`: Enforce **1440-minute (24-hour)** inactivity timeout with **explicit token invalidation on logout**.
- Session management must be **secure, traceable**, and **aligned with backend token lifecycle**, including revocation.

